        "paragraph_id": "2CB6FDB6",
        "text": "The dimensionless friction coefficient can be calculated from the Chézy value with (2.48). A typical Chézy value for sandy coasts is in the order of 55 m1/2/s."
      }
    ],
    "following_nonempty_paragraphs": [
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx",
